--- !u!114 &424692591
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 424692589}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "I\u2019m writing this note for travelers, warriors or survivors that will
    by any chance find themselves in this little restplace.\r\n\r\nIf you are trying
    to reach Vault 03, know that it is now destroyed and nothing remains. It all
    happened because Rylan, an inhabitant of our city, became a Doppelganger. If
    you encounter him, run away, if he already knew how to fight before, now as a
    Doppelganger he is invincible. He is easy to recognize, he has long brown hair,
    carries a greatsword and has gold and red armor.\r\n\r\nMy friends Damu and Martha
    and I tried to reach the Vault 02 by taking the short path, but it was completely
    blocked, without the necessary equipment you can't pass. \r\n\r\nNow that my
    friends died in the attempt of finding food, I'll try to get to the Vault 02
    through the depths on my own. I don't know how to get there, but I'll do it somehow.\r\n\r\nNow
    I would like to dedicate a couple of lines to my thoughts. Only now I understand
    that this whole vaults plan was a huge bullshit, we locked ourselves like rats
    in these uninhabitable holes and now we are all slowly being found, first the
    Vault 01, destroyed only after two months and now ours\u2026\r\nWe should have
    fought with Helen against Levir, I still regret not having followed her, I was
    a coward.\r"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c2e38e3571460d24bb6e14c5e27d44f4, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 9027014260544980051, guid: c2e38e3571460d24bb6e14c5e27d44f4, type: 2}
  m_fontSharedMaterials: []
  m_fontMaterial: {fileID: 0}
